    "上次写入中断了，没有替换已经保存的导图。恢复上一版会丢掉未完成的半截文件，留下上一个完整版本。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The last write was interrupted and did not replace the saved map. Restoring the previous version discards the incomplete file and keeps the last complete one."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上次写入中断了，没有替换已经保存的导图。恢复上一版会丢掉未完成的半截文件，留下上一个完整版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上次写入中断了，当前文件打不开。可以恢复快照里的上一版。只存在于损坏文件里的附件，打开时会按文件名指出。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The last write was interrupted and the current file won't open. You can restore the previous snapshot. Attachments that exist only in the damaged file are named when it opens."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
